text @[Tomoya]
text Could you please... work hard for me as well, then?
sound 89W.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text What are you saying...?
sound 89X.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Weren't you going to work hard from now on?
sound 89Y.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Weren't you going to work your ass off every day, once spring arrives?
sound 89Z.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text All I can do is support you from the sidelines...
sound 8A0.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Oh, but I can make your lunchboxes. I'll make them every day, and fill them with love.
text @[Tomoya]
text It looks like you'd be really dominating in our relationship.
sound 8A1.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I wouldn't. I'll leave you to decide everything.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 8A2.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text @So, please decide...
delay 164
text Tomoya.
text In front of me, there stands a girl who loves me.
text Telling me to stay with her from now on.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Please do.
text I take her hand.
