text @[Tomoyo]
text Tomoya...!
text Tears are pouring out of Tomoyo's eyes.
text She must have been anxious about this the entire time.
text Tomoyo cried like a child.
text This entire time, I had been a pathetic man.
text But things will be different from now on.
text I will protect this girl, so that she may always feel at ease...
text I have to do my best.
text I swear this...
text That's why, please...
text Stay with me, forever.
text ...Tomoyo.
