text There are two silhouettes climbing the hill.
text One of them I recognize.
text The other, I've never seen before.
text It's a freshman.
text Both of them look up as I walk.
text At the blooming sakura.
sound 8A5.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Nee-chan...
sound 8A6.aac
text @[Male Student]
text The sakura really are beautiful, aren't they...?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM16A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM16A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 8A7.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Of course they are.
sound 8A8.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That's why I protected them.
sound 8A9.aac
text @[Male Student]
text As if you're able to do something like that.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGTM18A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGTM18A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 8AA.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Are you making fun of me? Then don't look at them. You'll spoil the sakura.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Tomoya]
text So you're a big sister who gets angry over every little thing, huh?
text I say, looking down on the both of them.
text @[Tomoya]
text Tomoyo, wasn't everything you did in order to pay back this kid?
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't really see now why you went and protected these trees.
sound 8AB.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Amazing... He's not using honorifics for you...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, she's easygoing on these things.
text @[Tomoya]
text She'll even let me do this.
text I come close to her and pinch her cheek.
sound 8AC.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Mister, that's amazing!
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, to me, your sister's just like a kid.
text @[Tomoya]
text So call me if she bullies you. I'll come and save you.
sound 8AD.aac
text @[Male Student]
text She doesn't ever bully me or anything.
sound 8AE.aac
text @[Male Student]
text She's got a bad mouth, but my big sis is incredibly kind.
text @[Tomoya]
text Really? That's good, then, kid.
sound 8AF.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I'm not a kid. I'm called Takafumi.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, yeah? I'm Tomoya Okazaki.
sound 8AG.aac
text @[Takafumi]
text Ohh. So, why'd you come and talk to us?
sound 8AH.aac
text @[Takafumi]
text You're wearing work clothes, so I'm guessing you're not a student at this school.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's right...
text @[Tomoya]
text It just looked like you were being bullied, so I came to try and save you.
sound 8AI.aac
text @[Takafumi]
text So you're like a hero, huh?
text @[Tomoya]
text Something like that.
text @[Tomoya]
text So call me when you're in a bad spot, and I'll come running over.
sound 8AJ.aac
text @[Takafumi]
text Why, thank you.
text @[Tomoya]
text So for the future, pleased to meet you.
sound 8AK.aac
text @[Takafumi]
text I don't really understand the situation here, but pleased to meet you too.
text We shake hands.
text Grabbing my shoulder, Tomoyo whispers over to me.
